          "section": "abstract",
          "text": "The forkhead O (FoxO) family of transcription factors participates in diverse physiologic processes, including induction of cell-cycle arrest, stress resistance, differentiation, apoptosis, and metabolism.",
          "score": 0.7911686897277832,
          "page": null,
          "sentence_indices": [],
